  "title": {
    "type": "text",
    "$t": "佈稻仔"
  },
  "content": {
    "type": "html",
    "$t": "<p><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><span><span><b>作者：</b></span></span><span><b>藍春瑞</b></span></span></p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">雙溪khah無下港hiah-nī仔燒熱，平平是佈稻仔，割--起-來ê粟仔，十分賰七niâ，實在真無額。仝hit時tsūn，換去討海掠魚iah是礦區掘炭，趁錢顛倒ē khah大百，規家口仔有thang快活用，m̄-koh拄著歹運到底，老命不時ē休--去，iah是mài試tsiah好，人講「百般頭路，khah輸jio̍k田塗」，就是tsit个情理。</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">早冬佈稻仔，一百工就ē割--得，拄好是熱--人ê時tsūn，厝邊頭尾khah有thang sio換工，曝粟仔khah緊ta。啊若慢冬tsit水，就無sio-siāng--ah，7--月佈田11--月beh割，原本就無hiah-nī燒熱，稻仔細穗koh bē飽米，kap早冬來比phīng，割--起-來差不多有減兩成hit跤兜，上bái才--ê是tsiânn tsia̍p tn̄g著歹天落雨，稻仔是beh割iah m̄，想kah頭殼beh破--去。準講冗早割，koh驚粟仔siunn青無夠分，若beh khah uànn tsiah割，反顛倒tio̍h-ài操煩稻稿是m̄是ē áu--落-來、bak tâm ê粟仔是m̄是ē出芽、生菇，變kah bē食bē睏--得。</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">開春beh佈田ê秧仔，tio̍h-ài家己用粟仔來隱（ún），正月半tsiah過，tio̍h-ài隨tshuân米luâ（竹bi̍h仔做--ê，圓喙四角底）té粟仔，提去有行流水ê所在浸，圳仔頭淺水闊闊ê溝仔底上ha̍h。Thìng候三、四工仔過，粟頭ē pok一絲絲仔ê白芽，規个米luâ小可仔膨kuân--起-來ê時tsūn，tsiah用ta草仔khàm頂面，hōo伊lio̍h仔燒燒，ē khah快pok芽。Koh過四、五工，tsiah kā總pok芽ê粟種hôo--起-來，掖落去一坵進前早就圍便便、kā塗jio̍k kah tsiok幼、tsiok平ê細細坵田仔，上ke是一個月，秧仔發有一掠kuân，就ē-tàng thio起來佈田。論真來講，作田人ê穡頭，就是無錢thang tshiànn--人，tsiah tio̍h hiah-nī仔拚勢，m̄是食飽siunn閒leh揣khang-khuè來換iau，啊若手頭liōng-siōng ē得過ê人，tshit-thô to bē赴--ah，khah ē知影啥mi̍h號做佈田--leh！&nbsp;</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: x-small;\">（Tsit篇文章bat刊tī教育部電子報，漢羅用字有調整，原文網址：<a href=\"https://reurl.cc/M00plv\" target=\"_blank\">https://reurl.cc/M00plv</a>）</span></p><div style=\"text-align: justify;\"><br /></div><div><br /></div><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><a name='more'></a></span><div><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></div><div><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEicRzhuNfvQrLjHSz4rE7C-AGivX0wBkqONhorsZkLI0tEBAX_5cuafLrBVMvwKXjDumnKQbovF-_VEJYRqwK2V1ZS3VhY5YhLh1BNbZ6ebELP7o3VSUPZJC3VxP7LAxaW3f8C4G0Vy9N8WNu8uymmnbBiE7XzBsDJ_bSMw9-2c7SpugdQkZ1r-xsCaUw/s1421/338%E5%8F%B0%E6%96%87%E9%80%9A%E8%A8%8ABONG%E5%A0%B1_%E5%B0%81%E9%9D%A2.jpg\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><img border=\"0\" data-original-height=\"1421\" data-original-width=\"1000\" height=\"640\" src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEicRzhuNfvQrLjHSz4rE7C-AGivX0wBkqONhorsZkLI0tEBAX_5cuafLrBVMvwKXjDumnKQbovF-_VEJYRqwK2V1ZS3VhY5YhLh1BNbZ6ebELP7o3VSUPZJC3VxP7LAxaW3f8C4G0Vy9N8WNu8uymmnbBiE7XzBsDJ_bSMw9-2c7SpugdQkZ1r-xsCaUw/w450-h640/338%E5%8F%B0%E6%96%87%E9%80%9A%E8%A8%8ABONG%E5%A0%B1_%E5%B0%81%E9%9D%A2.jpg\" width=\"450\" /></span></a></div><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEj83ixCxd_VwRRjgOYOVe2qkRmhcyNpGt5RYNgOg1ONAWuF2laU1yXSs3oRmfBTC83-6jr6vCuWi8jbjky48JmcWrRNMlyrQk5TZn6Drx7JSbz_cx-VKaoG586BnQnfnubbVnhdgad23gBRV_yoOnqsDr5xK7sX7ln8Saa6VsRmHBiXROK1jHtDs_tqIQ/s3036/%E5%8F%B0%E6%96%87%E9%80%9A%E8%A8%8ABONG%E5%A0%B1338%E6%9C%9F_07.jpg\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"><img border=\"0\" data-original-height=\"3036\" data-original-width=\"2150\" height=\"640\" src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEj83ixCxd_VwRRjgOYOVe2qkRmhcyNpGt5RYNgOg1ONAWuF2laU1yXSs3oRmfBTC83-6jr6vCuWi8jbjky48JmcWrRNMlyrQk5TZn6Drx7JSbz_cx-VKaoG586BnQnfnubbVnhdgad23gBRV_yoOnqsDr5xK7sX7ln8Saa6VsRmHBiXROK1jHtDs_tqIQ/w454-h640/%E5%8F%B0%E6%96%87%E9%80%9A%E8%A8%8ABONG%E5%A0%B1338%E6%9C%9F_07.jpg\" width=\"454\" /></a></div><br /><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: cen